                                "sense_id": "079b5539-e920-3235-ad67-4d3527484988",
                                "text": "начи́слить кому́-либо зарпла́ту",
                                "translation": "to put someone on the payroll",
                                "english": "to put someone on the payroll"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3de564d0-e5bc-4fe9-8949-95b37a594818",
                                "sense_id": "079b5539-e920-3235-ad67-4d3527484988",
                                "text": "мне неве́рно начи́слили зарпла́ту за про́шлый ме́сяц",
                                "translation": "my salary for the past month was miscalculated; last month's payroll had the wrong amount of my salary",
